<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Represents the assortment of different foods in a colonist's diet, reflecting their ability to access and consume a wide range of nutrients and flavors, calculated as an average of the variety in meals and the variety in ingredients in those meals.\n\nLow values will cause a mood penalty, while higher values will cause a mood bonus.-->
  <VCEV_FoodVariety.description>代表殖民者饮食中不同食物的种类，反映他们获取和消耗各种营养素和口味的能力，以膳食种类和这些膳食中成分种类的平均值计算。

低值会导致情绪损失，而较高值会导致情绪奖励。</VCEV_FoodVariety.description>
  <!--EN: food variety-->
  <VCEV_FoodVariety.label>食物种类</VCEV_FoodVariety.label>
</LanguageData>
